  "description": "Fall Thankfully is cute font duo, combining monoline script font with swash and all caps bouncy sans serif with ligature. This font duo radiates fun, festive, and casual vibes. This font pairing will create happy and joyful touch into the design. It can be used separately.\nFall Thankfully is pretty font for lots of design, especially with bright and cute vibes, such as kids, school design, holiday, birthday invitation, summer design, holiday, t-shirt design, crafting, sticker, sublimation, and many more.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Fall Thankfully is cute font duo, combining monoline script font with swash and all caps bouncy sans serif with ligature. This font duo radiates fun, festive, and casual vibes. This font pairing will create happy and joyful touch into the design. It can be used separately.</p>\n<p>Fall Thankfully is pretty font for lots of design, especially with bright and cute vibes, such as kids, school design, holiday, birthday invitation, summer design, holiday, t-shirt design, crafting, sticker, sublimation, and many more.</p>",
